<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f7f9; --bg-soft: #f2f4f6; --card: #ffffff;
    --ink: #171c26; --ink-2: #3d4655; --muted: #71798a;
    --line: #e6e9ee; --line-soft: #f0f2f5;
    --brand: #c7000b; --brand-deep: #a00009; --brand-bright: #dd3340;
    --brand-soft: #fdf1f1; --brand-line: #f3d3d5;
    --ok: #15803d; --ok-bg: #ecfdf3;
    --warn: #b45309; --warn-bg: #fff7ed;
    --fail: #b91c1c; --fail-bg: #fef2f2;
    --shadow-1: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,28,38,.05), 0 2px 10px rgba(23,28,38,.05);
    --shadow-2: 0 6px 16px rgba(23,28,38,.09), 0 16px 40px rgba(23,28,38,.10);
    --radius: 12px; --radius-s: 9px;
    --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body { margin:0; font-family: var(--font); background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  ::selection { background: rgba(199,0,11,.16); }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid rgba(199,0,11,.45); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }

  header {
    color: #fff; padding: 30px 28px 28px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 320px at 88% -140px, rgba(255,255,255,.16), transparent 62%),
      radial-gradient(700px 300px at -8% 130%, rgba(255,255,255,.07), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #8a000a 0%, #c7000b 58%, #dd3340 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(154,0,10,.28);
  }
  .header-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .22em; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: .88; margin-bottom: 7px; }
  header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .01em; }
  .header-stats { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hstat { background: rgba(255,255,255,.13); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26); padding: 6px 13px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }

  main { padding: 22px 28px 48px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  section {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 22px 24px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
    transition: box-shadow .2s ease;
  }
  section:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-2); }
  section[id^="sec-"] { scroll-margin-top: 84px; }
  h2 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
  .sec-num {
    flex: none; min-width: 30px; height: 24px; padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 7px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-deep), var(--brand-bright));
    color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(199,0,11,.30);
  }
  .h2-note { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }
  h3 { margin: 18px 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }

  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .kpi { position: relative; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-s); padding: 13px 14px 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,28,38,.04); }
  .kpi::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--kpi-c, var(--brand)); }
  .kpi:nth-child(4n+1) { --kpi-c: #c7000b; }
  .kpi:nth-child(4n+2) { --kpi-c: #e8833a; }
  .kpi:nth-child(4n+3) { --kpi-c: #2f6f9f; }
  .kpi:nth-child(4n+4) { --kpi-c: #0e9c8a; }
  .kpi .label { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .kpi .value { font-size: 23px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 5px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink); }
  .kpi.primary { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff, #fdf4f4); border-color: var(--brand-line); }
  .kpi.primary .value { color: var(--brand); }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  thead th {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1; background: var(--card);
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-align: left; padding: 9px 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  td { padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft); color: var(--ink-2); }
  td:first-child { color: var(--ink); }
  tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tbody tr:hover td { background: #fdf6f6; }
  td.num, th.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
  .badge::before { content: ''; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; }
  .pass { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok); }
  .warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); }
  .fail { background: var(--fail-bg); color: var(--fail); }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .scroll { max-height: 420px; overflow: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-s); }
  .pane-src { margin: 0 0 14px 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 5px; }
  pre.muted { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11.5px; line-height: 1.6; background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-s); padding: 12px 14px; overflow: auto; }
  footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0 30px; }

  .chart-row { margin: 16px 0 22px; }
  .chart-box {
    position: relative; width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff, #fcfdfe);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: 10px 10px 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,28,38,.03);
  }
  .chart-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2); margin: 0 0 8px 4px; }
  .chart-title::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 3px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--brand); margin: 0 7px 0 2px; vertical-align: -1px; }

  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px; align-items: center; }
  .tab {
    border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); color: var(--ink-2);
    padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(23,28,38,.04);
    transition: color .15s, border-color .15s, background .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .tab:hover { color: var(--brand); border-color: var(--brand-line); background: var(--brand-soft); }
  .tab.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-deep), var(--brand-bright)); color: #fff; border-color: transparent; box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(199,0,11,.30); }
  .tab-group-label { align-self: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; padding: 0 2px 0 8px; }
  .tab-divider { width: 1px; align-self: stretch; background: var(--line); margin: 0 8px; }
  .pane[hidden] { display: none; }

  .pane-nav {
    position: sticky; top: 10px; z-index: 20;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 9px 10px; margin-bottom: 16px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.93); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }
  .pane-nav .chip {
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 13px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: color .15s, background .15s;
  }
  .pane-nav .chip:hover { color: var(--brand); background: var(--brand-soft); }
  .pane-nav .chip.active { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-deep), var(--brand-bright)); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(199,0,11,.28); }

  #back-to-top {
    position: fixed; right: 26px; bottom: 26px; z-index: 40; width: 42px; height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--card); color: var(--ink-2);
    cursor: pointer; box-shadow: var(--shadow-2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(10px);
    transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s, visibility .2s, color .15s, border-color .15s;
  }
  #back-to-top.show { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: none; }
  #back-to-top:hover { color: var(--brand); border-color: var(--brand); }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    header { padding: 22px 16px; }
    main { padding: 16px 12px 40px; }
    section { padding: 16px 14px 10px; }
    .pane-nav { top: 6px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="header-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">Ascend NPU · Profiling</div>
      <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="header-stats">
      {% if multi %}
      <span class="hstat">{{ machine_count }} 台机器</span>
      {% if runs | selectattr('kind', 'equalto', 'rank') | list %}
      <span class="hstat">{{ runs | selectattr('kind', 'equalto', 'rank') | list | length }} 个 Rank 页签</span>
      {% endif %}
      {% else %}{% if runs %}
      <span class="hstat">时间跨度 {{ '%.0f'|format(runs[0].summary.span_ms) }} ms</span>
      <span class="hstat">事件 {{ runs[0].summary.event_count }}</span>{%- endif %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<main>

{% if multi and groups | length > 1 %}
<nav class="tabs machine-tabs">
  <span class="tab-group-label">机器</span>
  {% for g in groups %}
  <button type="button" class="tab{% if loop.first %} active{% endif %}" data-mgroup="{{ g.idx }}">{{ g.label }}</button>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>
{% endif %}

{% for g in groups %}
<div class="mgroup" id="mgroup-{{ g.idx }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>

{% if g.machine_ctx %}
{% set m = g.machine_ctx %}
{% set mi = g.idx %}
{% set msprof = m.msprof %}
{% set metrics = m.metrics %}
{% set ttft = m.ttft %}
{% set ttft_breakdown = m.ttft_breakdown %}
<section class="machine-sec" id="machine-{{ mi }}">
  <h2>机器级数据 · {{ m.label }}<span class="h2-note">（{{ m.ranks }} 个 rank · 事件合计 {{ m.event_count }} · 跨度 {{ '%.0f'|format(m.span_ms) }} ms）</span></h2>
  {% if msprof and msprof.meta and (msprof.meta.torch_npu_version or msprof.meta.cann_version) %}
  {% set pc = msprof.meta.profiler_config or {} %}
  <p class="muted">环境：torch_npu {{ msprof.meta.torch_npu_version }} · CANN {{ msprof.meta.cann_version }}
    {%- if pc.activities %} · 采集 {{ pc.activities | join("+") }}{% endif %}
    {%- if pc.with_stack is defined %} · with_stack={{ pc.with_stack }}{% endif %}
    {%- if pc.record_shapes is defined %} · record_shapes={{ pc.record_shapes }}{% endif %}
    {%- if msprof.meta.parallel_groups %} · 并行组
      {%- for g, ranks in msprof.meta.parallel_groups.items() %} {{ g }}{{ ranks }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}

  <h3>TTFT 分解（机器级，来自插桩日志）</h3>
  {% if ttft_breakdown and ttft_breakdown.composition %}
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi primary"><div class="label">TTFT</div><div class="value">{% if ttft is not none %}{{ ttft }} ms{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">插桩日志</div><div class="value">{{ ttft_breakdown.matched_lines }} 行</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">来源：{{ ttft_breakdown.source if ttft_breakdown.source else '容器日志' }} · 全量统计。
    各段为独立打点（计数基准不同），「均值占比」为各段均值占链路均值之和的比例，不能直接相加还原单请求 TTFT。</p>
  {% if ttft_breakdown.request_chain %}
  <p class="muted">TTFT 卡片 = 每请求 8 段链路合计（hash/ext/alloc/overhead/load/forward/save/update）的 <b>p50</b>，
    样本 {{ ttft_breakdown.request_chain.count }} 个完成请求：
    mean {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.mean_ms) }} ms ·
    p95 {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.p95_ms) }} ms ·
    max {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.max_ms) }} ms
    （不含排队等待 / 分词 / 输出段）。</p>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">TTFT 分解 · 各段平均耗时（ms，悬停查看 p50/p95/count）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-ttft-comp-m{{ mi }}"></div>
  </div>
  <h4>链路分段统计</h4>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>分段</th><th>count</th><th>mean (ms)</th><th>p50 (ms)</th><th>p95 (ms)</th><th>max (ms)</th><th>均值占比</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in ttft_breakdown.composition %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.count }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.mean_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p50_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p95_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.max_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.1f' % r.pct }}%</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  <h4>KV pool 细分（vllm-ascend 插桩）</h4>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>分段</th><th>count</th><th>mean (ms)</th><th>p50 (ms)</th><th>p95 (ms)</th><th>max (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in ttft_breakdown.kvpool_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.count }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.mean_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p50_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p95_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.max_ms }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% if ttft_breakdown.token_stats %}
  <p class="muted">Token 命中统计：
    {%- for k, v in ttft_breakdown.token_stats.items() %} {{ k }}: count={{ v.count }}, mean={{ '%.1f' % v.mean }}{% if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% if metrics and metrics.available %}
  <p class="muted">完整指标数据（含外部工具指标）不内嵌于报告以控制体积，见 run 目录 <code>metrics.json</code>。</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% elif metrics and metrics.available %}
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi primary"><div class="label">TTFT</div><div class="value">{% if ttft is not none %}{{ ttft }} ms{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">完整指标数据不内嵌于报告以控制体积，见 run 目录 <code>metrics.json</code>。</p>
  {% else %}
  <p><span class="badge warn">数据源未接入</span>
    {{ metrics.reason if metrics and metrics.reason else "metrics.json 未提供" }}。
    通过 <code>parse_metrics.py --container &lt;name&gt; --log-file &lt;容器内日志路径&gt;</code> 解析插桩日志，
    或 <code>--tool-cmd</code> 接入外部推导工具。</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if m.step_total %}
  <h3>逐步 Overlap（step_trace_time.csv，多 rank 取均值）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>step</th><th class="num">Computing (ms)</th><th class="num">Comm (ms)</th><th class="num">Comm·NotOverlapped (ms)</th><th class="num">Overlapped (ms)</th><th class="num">Free (ms)</th><th class="num">Stage (ms)</th><th class="num">Bubble (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in m.step_display %}
      <tr><td>{{ s.step }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.computing_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.communication_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.comm_not_overlapped_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.overlapped_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.free_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.stage_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.bubble_us / 1000) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">来源 msprof step_trace_time.csv；Computing/Communication/Overlapped/Free 与 Overlap Analysis 轨道同口径。
    {%- if m.step_total > m.step_display|length %} 已截断显示前 {{ m.step_display|length }} / {{ m.step_total }} 步，全量见 run 目录 msprof_summary.json。{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}

  {% if msprof and msprof.api_statistic %}
  <h3>Host API 统计（Top 20）</h3>
  <p class="muted">来源 msprof api_statistic.csv（{{ msprof.api_statistic | length }} 项，按总耗时降序）。
    Level：acl = AscendCL，runtime，node，communication 等。</p>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>level</th><th>API</th><th class="num">time (ms)</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">avg (us)</th><th class="num">min (us)</th><th class="num">max (us)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for a in msprof.api_statistic[:20] %}
      <tr><td>{{ a.level }}</td><td>{{ a.name }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(a.time_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ a.count }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.avg_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.min_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.max_us) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if msprof and msprof.communication and msprof.communication.ops %}
  {% set ct = msprof.communication.totals %}
  <h3>通信耗时分解（communication.json，{{ msprof.communication.ops | length }} 类操作）</h3>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">总时长</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.elapse_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">等待</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.wait_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">同步</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.sync_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">空闲</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.idle_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">传输</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.transit_ms) }} ms</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">通信操作耗时构成 · Top 12（等待/同步/空闲/传输 堆叠，悬停查看）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-comm-stack-m{{ mi }}"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>op</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">elapse (ms)</th><th class="num">wait (ms)</th><th class="num">sync (ms)</th><th class="num">idle (ms)</th><th class="num">transit (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for c in msprof.communication.ops %}
      <tr><td>{{ c.op }}</td><td class="num">{{ c.count }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.elapse_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.wait_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.sync_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.idle_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.transit_ms) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if msprof and msprof.communication_matrix %}
  <h3>通信矩阵（rank-pair，communication_matrix.json）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>pair</th><th>transport</th><th class="num">size (MB)</th><th class="num">time (ms)</th><th class="num">带宽 (GB/s)</th><th class="num">ops</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for mtx in msprof.communication_matrix %}
      <tr><td>{{ mtx.pair }}</td><td>{{ mtx.transport }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(mtx.size_mb) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.3f"|format(mtx.time_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(mtx.bandwidth_gbs) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ mtx.ops }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% set rpanes = g.panes | selectattr('kind', 'equalto', 'rank') | list %}
{% if rpanes | length > 1 %}
<nav class="tabs rank-tabs">
  <span class="tab-group-label">Rank</span>
  {% for r in rpanes %}
  <button type="button" class="tab{% if loop.first %} active{% endif %}" data-pane="pane-{{ r.idx }}">{{ r.label }}</button>
  {% endfor %}
</nav>
{% endif %}

{% for run in g.panes %}
{% set ri = run.idx %}
{% set summary = run.summary %}
{% set top = run.top %}
{% set overlap = run.overlap %}
{% set mem = run.mem %}
{% set comm = run.comm %}
{% set msprof = run.msprof %}
{% set metrics = run.metrics %}
{% set ttft = run.ttft %}
{% set ttft_breakdown = run.ttft_breakdown %}
{% set completeness = run.completeness %}
{% set source = run.source %}
{% set is_machine = run.kind == 'head' %}
{% set secno = namespace(n=0) %}
<div class="pane{% if run.kind == 'rank' %} rpane{% else %} hpane{% endif %}" id="pane-{{ ri }}"{% if run.tab_hidden %} hidden{% endif %}>
<nav class="pane-nav">
  <a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-summary">汇总</a>
  <a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-top">Top 算子</a>
  <a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-npu">NPU 利用率</a>
  <a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-mem">内存</a>
  <a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-comm">通信</a>
  {% if is_machine and msprof and msprof.api_statistic %}<a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-api">Host API</a>{% endif %}
  {% if is_machine %}<a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-ttft">TTFT</a>{% endif %}
  {% if completeness %}<a class="chip" href="#sec-{{ ri }}-complete">完整性</a>{% endif %}
</nav>
<p class="pane-src">source: {{ source }}</p>

{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-summary">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>汇总统计</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">时间跨度</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(summary.span_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">事件总数</div><div class="value">{{ summary.event_count }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">内核 launch 数</div><div class="value">{{ summary.node_launch_count }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">唯一内核</div><div class="value">{{ summary.unique_kernel_count }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi primary"><div class="label">TTFT</div><div class="value">{% if ttft is not none %}{{ ttft }} ms{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
  </div>
  {% if msprof and msprof.meta and (msprof.meta.torch_npu_version or msprof.meta.cann_version) %}
  {% set pc = msprof.meta.profiler_config or {} %}
  <p class="muted">环境：torch_npu {{ msprof.meta.torch_npu_version }} · CANN {{ msprof.meta.cann_version }}
    {%- if pc.activities %} · 采集 {{ pc.activities | join("+") }}{% endif %}
    {%- if pc.with_stack is defined %} · with_stack={{ pc.with_stack }}{% endif %}
    {%- if pc.record_shapes is defined %} · record_shapes={{ pc.record_shapes }}{% endif %}
    {%- if msprof.meta.parallel_groups %} · 并行组
      {%- for g, ranks in msprof.meta.parallel_groups.items() %} {{ g }}{{ ranks }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}

  <h3>逻辑进程</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>pid</th><th>name</th><th>label</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for p in summary.processes %}
      <tr><td>{{ p.pid }}</td><td>{{ p.name }}</td><td>{{ p.label }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3>事件类别</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>cat</th><th class="num">count</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for k, v in summary.categories.items() %}
      <tr><td>{{ k }}</td><td class="num">{{ v }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-top">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>Top-N 算子<span class="h2-note">（{{ run.top_source }}）</span></h2>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">Top kernels by total duration（悬停查看指标）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-top-kernels-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">Hardware task time by task type（悬停查看指标）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-task-types-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>

  <h3>Top {{ top.top|length }} / 共 {{ top.all_count }} 个内核（按总时长）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>kernel</th>
        <th class="num">count</th>
        <th class="num">total (us)</th>
        <th class="num">avg (us)</th>
        <th class="num">max (us)</th>
        <th class="num">%</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in top.top %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.kernel }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ r.count }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.total_dur_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.avg_dur_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.max_dur_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(r.pct_of_kernel_time) }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  <h3>硬件 task type 分布</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>task type</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">total (us)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for t in top.task_types %}
      <tr><td>{{ t.type }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.count }}</td><td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(t.total_dur_us) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-npu">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>NPU 利用率<span class="h2-note">（Overlap Analysis）</span></h2>
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">NPU utilization（悬停查看指标）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-overlap-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">NPU activity timeline（悬停查看指标）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-overlap-timeline-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>
  <h3>轨道时长</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>track</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">total (us)</th><th class="num">%</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for t in overlap.tracks %}
      <tr><td>{{ t.track }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.count }}</td><td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(t.total_us) }}</td><td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(t.pct) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% if is_machine and msprof and msprof.step_trace_time %}
  <h3>逐步 Overlap（step_trace_time.csv，多 rank 取均值）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>step</th><th class="num">Computing (ms)</th><th class="num">Comm (ms)</th><th class="num">Comm·NotOverlapped (ms)</th><th class="num">Overlapped (ms)</th><th class="num">Free (ms)</th><th class="num">Stage (ms)</th><th class="num">Bubble (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for s in run.step_display %}
      <tr><td>{{ s.step }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.computing_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.communication_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.comm_not_overlapped_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.overlapped_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.free_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.stage_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(s.bubble_us / 1000) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">来源 msprof step_trace_time.csv；Computing/Communication/Overlapped/Free 与 Overlap Analysis 轨道同口径。
    {%- if run.step_total > run.step_display|length %} 已截断显示前 {{ run.step_display|length }} / {{ run.step_total }} 步，全量见 run 目录 msprof_summary.json。{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-mem">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>内存活动代理</h2>
  <p class="muted">{{ mem.note }}{% if mem.h2d_d2h_bytes %} H2D/D2H 累计 {{ mem.h2d_d2h_bytes }} bytes。{% endif %}</p>
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">Memcpy / empty_tensor / H2D-D2H（悬停查看指标）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-memory-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>
  <h3>活动量合计</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>kind</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">total</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for k, v in mem.totals.items() %}
      <tr><td>{{ k }}</td><td class="num">{{ mem.counts.get(k, 0) }}</td><td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(v) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-comm">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>通信</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">通信事件</div><div class="value">{{ comm.event_count }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">总字节</div><div class="value">{{ comm.total_bytes }}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">平均带宽</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(comm.avg_bandwidth_gbs) }} GB/s</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">峰值带宽</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(comm.max_bandwidth_gbs) }} GB/s</div></div>
  </div>
  <h3>按 task type</h3>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>type</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">bytes</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for t in comm.by_type %}
      <tr><td>{{ t.type }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.count }}</td><td class="num">{{ t.bytes }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% if is_machine and msprof and msprof.communication and msprof.communication.ops %}
  {% set ct = msprof.communication.totals %}
  <h3>通信耗时分解（communication.json，{{ msprof.communication.ops | length }} 类操作）</h3>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">总时长</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.elapse_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">等待</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.wait_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">同步</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.sync_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">空闲</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.idle_ms) }} ms</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">传输</div><div class="value">{{ "%.1f"|format(ct.transit_ms) }} ms</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">通信操作耗时构成 · Top 12（等待/同步/空闲/传输 堆叠，悬停查看）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-comm-stack-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>op</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">elapse (ms)</th><th class="num">wait (ms)</th><th class="num">sync (ms)</th><th class="num">idle (ms)</th><th class="num">transit (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for c in msprof.communication.ops %}
      <tr><td>{{ c.op }}</td><td class="num">{{ c.count }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.elapse_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.wait_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.sync_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.idle_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(c.transit_ms) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  {% if is_machine and msprof and msprof.communication_matrix %}
  <h3>通信矩阵（rank-pair，communication_matrix.json）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>pair</th><th>transport</th><th class="num">size (MB)</th><th class="num">time (ms)</th><th class="num">带宽 (GB/s)</th><th class="num">ops</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for m in msprof.communication_matrix %}
      <tr><td>{{ m.pair }}</td><td>{{ m.transport }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(m.size_mb) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.3f"|format(m.time_ms) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(m.bandwidth_gbs) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ m.ops }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% if is_machine and msprof and msprof.api_statistic %}
{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-api">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>Host API 统计</h2>
  <p class="muted">来源 msprof api_statistic.csv（{{ msprof.api_statistic | length }} 项，按总耗时降序 Top 20）。
    Level：acl = AscendCL，runtime，node，communication 等。</p>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>level</th><th>API</th><th class="num">time (ms)</th><th class="num">count</th><th class="num">avg (us)</th><th class="num">min (us)</th><th class="num">max (us)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for a in msprof.api_statistic[:20] %}
      <tr><td>{{ a.level }}</td><td>{{ a.name }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(a.time_us / 1000) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ a.count }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.avg_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.min_us) }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(a.max_us) }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if is_machine %}
{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-ttft">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>TTFT 分解</h2>
  {% if ttft_breakdown and ttft_breakdown.composition %}
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi primary"><div class="label">TTFT</div><div class="value">{% if ttft is not none %}{{ ttft }} ms{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
    <div class="kpi"><div class="label">插桩日志</div><div class="value">{{ ttft_breakdown.matched_lines }} 行</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">来源：{{ ttft_breakdown.source if ttft_breakdown.source else '容器日志' }} · 全量统计。
    各段为独立打点（计数基准不同），「均值占比」为各段均值占链路均值之和的比例，不能直接相加还原单请求 TTFT。</p>
  {% if ttft_breakdown.request_chain %}
  <p class="muted">TTFT 卡片 = 每请求 8 段链路合计（hash/ext/alloc/overhead/load/forward/save/update）的 <b>p50</b>，
    样本 {{ ttft_breakdown.request_chain.count }} 个完成请求：
    mean {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.mean_ms) }} ms ·
    p95 {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.p95_ms) }} ms ·
    max {{ '%.1f'|format(ttft_breakdown.request_chain.max_ms) }} ms
    （不含排队等待 / 分词 / 输出段）。</p>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="chart-row">
    <div class="chart-title">TTFT 分解 · 各段平均耗时（ms，悬停查看 p50/p95/count）</div>
    <div class="chart-box" id="chart-ttft-comp-{{ ri }}"></div>
  </div>
  <h3>链路分段统计</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>分段</th><th>count</th><th>mean (ms)</th><th>p50 (ms)</th><th>p95 (ms)</th><th>max (ms)</th><th>均值占比</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in ttft_breakdown.composition %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.count }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.mean_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p50_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p95_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.max_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.1f' % r.pct }}%</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  <h3>KV pool 细分（vllm-ascend 插桩）</h3>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>分段</th><th>count</th><th>mean (ms)</th><th>p50 (ms)</th><th>p95 (ms)</th><th>max (ms)</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for r in ttft_breakdown.kvpool_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ r.name }}</td><td>{{ r.count }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.mean_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p50_ms }}</td>
        <td>{{ '%.3f' % r.p95_ms }}</td><td>{{ '%.3f' % r.max_ms }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
  {% if ttft_breakdown.token_stats %}
  <p class="muted">Token 命中统计：
    {%- for k, v in ttft_breakdown.token_stats.items() %} {{ k }}: count={{ v.count }}, mean={{ '%.1f' % v.mean }}{% if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% if metrics and metrics.available %}
  <p class="muted">完整指标数据（含外部工具指标）不内嵌于报告以控制体积，见 run 目录 <code>metrics.json</code>。</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% elif metrics and metrics.available %}
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="kpi primary"><div class="label">TTFT</div><div class="value">{% if ttft is not none %}{{ ttft }} ms{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted">完整指标数据不内嵌于报告以控制体积，见 run 目录 <code>metrics.json</code>。</p>
  {% else %}
  <p><span class="badge warn">数据源未接入</span>
    {{ metrics.reason if metrics and metrics.reason else "metrics.json 未提供" }}。
    通过 <code>parse_metrics.py --container &lt;name&gt; --log-file &lt;容器内日志路径&gt;</code> 解析插桩日志，
    或 <code>--tool-cmd</code> 接入外部推导工具。</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if completeness %}
{% set secno.n = secno.n + 1 %}
<section id="sec-{{ ri }}-complete">
  <h2><span class="sec-num">{{ '%02d'|format(secno.n) }}</span>数据完整性
    <span class="badge {{ completeness.overall }}">{{ completeness.overall }}</span>
  </h2>
  <div class="scroll">
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>check</th><th>status</th><th>detail</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for c in completeness.checks %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ c.name }}</td>
        <td><span class="badge {{ c.status }}">{{ c.status }}</span></td>
        <td class="muted">{{ c.detail }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

</div>
{% endfor %}

</div>
{% endfor %}

</main>
<footer>generated by vllm-ascend-profiling skill · self-contained single-file HTML · interactive charts</footer>

